    <h1>GoDaddy Website Builder vs. <em>a custom-coded site built to bring in calls</em></h1>
    <p>GoDaddy puts your domain, hosting, email, and website builder behind one login. For a brand-new business on a tight budget, that convenience has clear appeal. This page compares something else: whether your phone rings.</p>
  </div>
