    <h2>What one extra call a week is worth</h2>
    <p>When each missed lead is worth hundreds of dollars or more, the monthly bill is the small cost. In a worked example for a typical local business, a $500 average job and one extra call a week come to $26,000 a year in potential work. At $5,000 a job, it's 10 times that. The GoDaddy bundle is convenient, but against strong local competition it falls short on what brings in leads.</p>

